$b_{4}  b_{5}  \textcolor{blue}{ b_{6} } \;b_{7}  b_{8}  \textcolor{blue}{ b_{9} } \;b_{1}  b_{2}  \textcolor{blue}{ b_{3} } $& 0  & 0  & 0  & 0  & 0  & 0  & 0  & 0  \\
