The hard-level oracle is using substantially more reasoning time than at 36 blocks, which is the intended scaling signal, but latency itself will not count toward the verdict. I’m continuing to wait for a scored response under the harness’s fixed deadline.
diff --git a/gen_2601_19161.py b/gen_2601_19161.py
